flowchart TD
    U["User request"] --> B["Engineer: define scope and acceptance criteria"]
    B --> G0{"Scope Ready?"}
    G0 -->|No| H["Clarify or obtain scope approval"]
    H --> B
    G0 -->|Yes| E["Engineer: plan, implement, test, debug<br/>One continuous coding session"]

    S["Skills loaded on demand"] -.-> E
    E -.->|Optional bounded subtask| W["Temporary Worker<br/>Separate scope and workspace"]
    W -.->|Evidence and change references| E

    E --> C["Run required checks<br/>Open draft PR only if authorized"]
    C --> G1{"Checks Passed?"}
    G1 -->|Fail| RB{"Execution budget available?"}
    RB -->|Yes| E
    RB -->|No| X["Escalate to user"]
    G1 -->|Evidence unavailable| BL["BLOCKED<br/>Save reason and resume point"]
    G1 -->|Pass| V["Independent Verifier session<br/>Approved scope, diff, CI, exact SHAs"]

    V --> G2{"Review verdict"}
    G2 -->|BLOCKED| BL
    G2 -->|CHANGES_REQUIRED| R{"Fewer than 2 fix-and-reverify cycles?"}
    R -->|Yes| F["Engineer fixes findings<br/>Increment cycle and invalidate old review"]
    F --> E
    R -->|No| X
    G2 -->|PASS| P["PR_READY<br/>Default delivery endpoint"]

    P --> A{"Specific high-impact action authorized?"}
    A -->|No| WAIT["Await user decision<br/>Do not merge or publish"]
    A -->|Yes| Q{"Scope, code, checks and authorization still current?"}
    Q -->|No| RE["Invalidate stale evidence<br/>Return to affected gate"]
    RE --> B
    Q -->|Yes| ACT["User or authorized executor performs that action"]
    ACT --> OBS{"Actual outcome confirmed?"}
    OBS -->|No| BL
    OBS -->|Yes| DONE["Record observed result<br/>MERGED, RELEASED or DEPLOYED"]
